## Install

Install it from [extensions.gnome.org](https://extensions.gnome.org/extension/{id}/{slug}/), or from the zip of a [release](https://github.com/frostyard/{repo}/releases):

```sh
gnome-extensions install {uuid}.shell-extension.zip
gnome-extensions enable {uuid}
```

